{
  "statement": "While I acknowledge the importance of efficiency and energy savings, the integrity and security of transactions must not be compromised. The proposed temporary overdraft limits raise concerns regarding user trust and unauthorized transactions, as highlighted by SAF-01 and SAF-03. I propose a synthesis: we can allow temporary overdrafts but implement strict auditing mechanisms (TRU-03) and notifications (TRU-06) to ensure users are well-informed of their account status and the risks involved. This way, we maintain user trust while enhancing operational efficiency and security.",
